    <div class="callout" style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <p><strong>The foundational principle:</strong> Segmentation purpose must drive variable selection — not the other way around. Before any data is collected or analyzed, identify which decisions this segmentation needs to inform and which audiences will act on the findings. The method follows the purpose (Yankelovich &amp; Meer, 2006).</p>
